ies for reveal-authorized asset delivery, no public/static/guessable MS assets, no frontend preload/static props/route-loader/client-bundle MS exposure, role-gated teacher/admin preview, document-only not becoming default in-app full-document reveal, visual QA required for any future screenshot promotion, and Copilot MS-line explanation as contract-only.\n\n## Changed Files\n\n- `scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.test.js`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.readback.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-source-image-evidence-posture.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-review-payload-final-closeout.test.js` -> 3 suites passed, 18 tests passed.\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.test.js` -> passed.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-amendment-boundary.mjs --write` -> validation_status `pass`.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> clean worktree; healthy artifact guard and A+ ratchet; warnings only for branch naming and local ahead-before-push state.\n\n## Side Effects\n\nNo MS assets, screenshots, production Supabase writes, production RAG reindex, vector mutation, frontend integration, OCR/VLM/model execution, or raw MS text storage were performed.\n","created_at":"2026-07-08T03:51:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T04:00:40Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T04:00:40Z",